#: ../../talk/index.rst:3
msgid "Talk"
msgstr "Konuş"

#: ../../talk/index.rst:5
msgid ""
"Nextcloud Talk offers audio/video and text chat integrated in Nextcloud. It "
"is available as a web interface, desktop client, and mobile apps for Android"
" and iOS."
msgstr ""
"Nextcloud Talk, Nextcloud ile bütünleşik sesli/görüntülü ve yazılı sohbet "
"sunar. Android ve iOS için bir internet arayüzü, bilgisayar istemcisi ve "
"mobil uygulamalar ile kullanılabilir."

#: ../../talk/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"You can find out more about Nextcloud Talk `on our website "
"<https://nextcloud.com/talk/>`_. Download the desktop and mobile clients "
"from `nextcloud.com/install <https://nextcloud.com/install/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Nextcloud Konuş ile ilgili ayrıntılı bilgi almak için sitemize "
"<https://nextcloud.com/talk/>`_ bakabilirsiniz. Bilgisayar ve mobil "
"istemcileri `nextcloud.com/install <https://nextcloud.com/install/>`_ "
"adresinden indirebilirsiniz."
